---
description: Motion site kit rules
globs: ["site/**/*.ts", "site/**/*.css", "site/**/*.html"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read spec.json and reference/tokens.json before changing styles. Use CSS variables generated from tokens.json; never hardcode hex values.
- The WebGL render loop lives in site/src/webgl/scene.ts. Do not move it, and do not touch it when editing DOM sections.
- One scroll driver (GSAP ScrollTrigger). One animation library. No framer-motion, no Lenis unless already present.
- Every animation has a prefers-reduced-motion branch.
- Never re-export or modify assets/model.glb.
- Keep the LICENSE header comment at the top of every source file.
